          "role": "other",
          "body": "The Board root query drops both checks and calls the function in their place [1]. Because the Quick question check sat after `archivedAt`, the condition order changes slightly; Postgres treats `AND` order as irrelevant for results. Brief search [2] and top-level agent search [3] make the same swap. Agent search keeps its extra `rootConversationId = conversationId` check, which guards `limit` against bad rows and is not part of the listed rule.",
